<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ICI half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ICI half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>				    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    186.9 vs 172.6</p>
<p>    Net				     110.7 vs  92.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     20.0 vs  18.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Chemicals group ICI Australia Ltd is 62.4 percent owned by Imperial Chemical Industries Plc.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.69 vs 1.69</p>
<p>    Other income			   21.3 vs 17.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    37.3 vs 31.2</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date July 11</p>
<p>Reg date June 30</p>
<p>    Tax					67.0 vs 53.9</p>
<p>    Interest				 18.6 vs 13.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   73.6 vs 60.1</p>
<p>    Minorities				9.2 vs  9.4</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
